ll","topics":["angular","javascript","pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27109,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Control groups track errors of their inner controls. Meaning, whenever an error exists on a single form control because of its validity state, the outer control group becomes invalid too and should give access to all errors in that control group.\n\nExample:\n\n```\n<form>\n  <div ngControlGroup=\"name\" #nameGroup=\"ngForm\">\n    <input ngControl=\"firstname\" minlength=\"3\">\n    <input ngControl=\"lastname\" minlength=\"3\">\n  </div>\n</form>\n```\n\nWhen `firstname` or `lastname` is invalid, `nameGroup` gets invalid too, however, `errors` stays `null`. \n\n**Note** that this is a template-driven form and might not be an issue in a model-driven form.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7323/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":603621065,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDYwMzYyMTA2NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/603621065","actor":{"login":"vsavkin","id":35996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsavkin","html_url":"https://github.com/vsavkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsavkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsavkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsavkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsavkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}"